    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HCD2Y3QZVFKSD7XMKXP8ZWPQ\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to use company-specific organization tags to add your company's name and address to the footer of your emails. If you ever update your company name or address in your account settings, those updates will be reflected in any messages using these tags. Including a physical mailing address in your emails is important in order to comply with certain regulations, like CAN-SPAM. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCD2Y3QZP8WQWV73TDAZSMY1\">Set your company information</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Click you company name in the bottom-left corner of Klaviyo. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Settings</strong>. </li>\n<li>Select <strong>Organization</strong>.\n<ul>\n<li>This option appears only for account Owners and Admins.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Complete or update all fields, then click <strong>Update Information</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCD2Y3QZD6B4PMW1Z494R8X0\">Add company information to an email template</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>From any text field (e.g., text block in an email, SMS editor, push message editor), click the personalization icon.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32002694734619\">\n</li>\n<li>From the <strong>All types</strong> menu, choose <strong>Organization</strong>. </li>\n<li>Choose an organization tag, like Organization name or Organization address. </li>\n</ol>\n<p>Learn about additional <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408802648731-Guide-to-Template-Tags-and-Variable-Syntax-new-editor-#account-variables-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">organization tags</a> available to use in your messages.  </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCD2Y3QZVGMKHKQTDPSNZF7N\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408802648731\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Message personalization reference</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005413888\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to create and manage universal and saved content</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCD2Y3QZ0K5JPH1896CCF0DF\"> </h2>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
